 * The tiers, prices and deliverables below are the previous edition's offering,
 * carried over untouched. They are kept
 * here verbatim so the 2026 numbers can be edited in place rather than rebuilt
 * from scratch, and the file is `_`-prefixed so nothing imports it by accident.
 *
 * They were pulled out of pages/[lang]/sponsors.astro rather than commented out
 * inline because HTML comments are passed straight through to the built page —
 * the prices would have been readable in page source while still unannounced.
 *
 * To publish: fix the numbers and the deliverables (several tiers still promise
 * a "Keynote Intro" and a "Technical Talk Slot", neither of which exists this
 * edition), then in pages/[lang]/sponsors.astro replace the "coming soon" panel
 * with `<SponsorshipPlans />` and restore the `Faq` import.
 */
